# pp5bw30-s0r4bs: the current form (2026-11-11). The pp5bw30 layout with the jor switches, the two PipeSpec overhead
# cuts of overlays/bs, and stage 0 at 4-bit.
# Stage 0 at 4-bit is a different checkpoint directory, not a switch: build it with tools/stage0-4bit and point
# HOST_MODEL_DIR in host.env at it on BOTH hosts. With stage 0 at 4-bit the KV pool is 873,536 tokens.
# Same nodes, partition and speculative config as pp5bw30.env; container names stay glm53-pp5bw30-n<rank>.
# shellcheck source=pp5bw30.env
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/pp5bw30.env"
# The jor set with the two bs files in place of g5's model runner and the recipe's pp_utils.
MOUNTS=mounts-bs.list
# The three jor switches (layouts/pp5bw30-jor.env), then the two cuts:
# CMP_BS_RXLATE=1: PP ranks 1..PP-2 post the receive of a chunk-A step after the forward of the chunk B behind it.
# CMP_BS_P1EARLY=1: the last rank sends a dropped chunk B's message and P1 right after the drop decision.
EXTRA_ENV="CMP_JO_NOSTOP=1 CMP_JO_REDIRECT=154842 CMP_JO_LOG=2000 CMP_BS_RXLATE=1 CMP_BS_P1EARLY=1"
